-- provenance comments above each entry stay true.
--
-- WHY THIS FILE EXISTS. The client returns a numeric sourceType per appearance
-- and nothing else. Confirmed live on 2026-08-19: dumping all 21 tooltip lines
-- for item 21392 returned name, item level, binding, damage, stats, set
-- membership and a class restriction - and no source of any kind. sourceType
-- 3 is all the API can say, and a collector cannot act on that alone.
--
-- Every ID below was read out of a real Wowhead URL and confirmed by a second
-- independent read (or, for the largest vendor groups added 2026-09-14, one
-- confirmed representative item plus real grouping evidence - a vendor's own
-- full sell-list page, or a shared item-set - extended to the rest of that
-- vendor's matching set, per an explicit scope decision to make the biggest
-- research categories tractable). Anything that could not be verified was
-- omitted rather than guessed - see the COULD NOT VERIFY blocks in the
-- research files.
